<title>UK: Sun Life appoints new deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>Sun Life appoints new deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Life and Provincial Holdings Plc said it had appointed Jacques-Henri Gougenheim as deputy chairman.</p>
<p>Gougenheim was previously deputy chairman of Sun Life Corporation Plc, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
